## Programme

- 12:00 Welcome
- 12:05 One dashboard, one question
- 12:20 Numbers that people can check
- 12:40 A live review of a real report
- 12:50 Questions from the audience

Send us a screenshot of a report that your team does not trust. We pick two and review them in the session, without names.

## Who it is for

The webinar is for finance managers and operations leads who read reports every week and doubt some of the numbers. No technical knowledge is needed.

The link arrives by email after you register.
